<title>GERMANY: Gerresheimer falls on lower 96 profits.</title>
<headline>Gerresheimer falls on lower 96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German glass-maker Gerresheimer Glas were the biggest losers around mid-session bourse trade on Monday after the group reported slightly lower group net profit for calendar 1996.</p>
<p>Shares in Gerresheimer Glas were down 4.05 marks, 11.10 percent, at 32.45 marks, while the overall market was up 28.07 points, or 0.85 percent, at 3,326.31 points.</p>
<p>The group did not give actual group net profit figures for 1996, but said that it was &quot;slightly down on last year&quot;. It said first-quarter trading had been hit by price pressure and a market slump.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
